          "text": "Right eye symptoms reported by telephone"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Gritty and irritated for ages, worse over the past few weeks; increased watering and mild redness, worse in wind and at night. Wakes with the eye stuck and sore. Reports the eye is a bit red inside and lashes are poking in."
      }
    },
